    "categories": ["childcare-education", "health-disability"],
    "summary": "Early intervention services for children under 3 who have a developmental delay or a disability -- therapies, developmental support, and family coaching, coordinated through the family's county program.",
    "benefit": "An individualized family service plan: developmental, physical, occupational, and speech therapy, service coordination, and family support. Costs are on a sliding parental-fee scale; services are not denied for inability to pay.",
